1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:03,037
In this town, the weather has a remote control.

2
00:00:04,027 --> 00:00:07,004
And only the mayor is allowed to touch it.

3
00:00:07,993 --> 00:00:09,455
Sunny for his birthday.

4
00:00:09,927 --> 00:00:11,086
Snow on Christmas.

5
00:00:11,727 --> 00:00:15,007
Rain on the day of the school trip. Every year.

6
00:00:16,093 --> 00:00:18,465
Nobody knows why he hates school trips.

7
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:22,843
My best friend Kai says the remote is just a myth.

8
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:27,340
So we snuck into the town hall to find it.

9
00:00:28,427 --> 00:00:29,586
It was real.

10
00:00:30,227 --> 00:00:32,002
Big. Silver. One hundred buttons.

11
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:34,022
Buttons like "light breeze."

12
00:00:34,493 --> 00:00:35,046
"Rainbow."

13
00:00:36,293 --> 00:00:37,452
"Fog. Extra thick."

14
00:00:38,093 --> 00:00:40,465
And one red button covered in tape.

15
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:42,419
Kai pressed "snow."

16
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:43,916
In July.

17
00:00:44,860 --> 00:00:46,625
Outside, kids screamed with joy.

18
00:00:47,193 --> 00:00:48,958
The whole town turned white.

19
00:00:49,527 --> 00:00:50,989
Then Kai got curious.

20
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,013
Tornado.

21
00:00:53,260 --> 00:00:54,722
Just a small one.

22
00:00:55,193 --> 00:00:56,655
It was not small.

23
00:00:57,127 --> 00:00:58,892
It picked up the bakery.

24
00:00:59,460 --> 00:01:00,922
Then the school bus.

25
00:01:01,393 --> 00:01:02,552
Then the mayor.

26
00:01:03,193 --> 00:01:04,958
We had to fix it.

27
00:01:05,527 --> 00:01:06,686
I pressed "calm."

28
00:01:07,327 --> 00:01:07,880
Nothing.

29
00:01:09,127 --> 00:01:09,680
"Sunny."

30
00:01:10,927 --> 00:01:11,480
Nothing.

31
00:01:12,727 --> 00:01:14,189
The batteries were dying.

32
00:01:14,660 --> 00:01:16,728
Only one button still had power.

33
00:01:17,393 --> 00:01:18,552
The red one.

34
00:01:19,193 --> 00:01:20,958
Under the tape, it said:

35
00:01:21,527 --> 00:01:22,989
"Do not press. Ever."

36
00:01:23,460 --> 00:01:24,922
Kai looked at me.

37
00:01:25,393 --> 00:01:27,765
The tornado was coming straight for us.

38
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:29,719
I pressed it.

39
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:31,216
Everything stopped.

40
00:01:32,160 --> 00:01:33,030
The tornado.

41
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:34,816
The wind.

42
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:36,616
The birds.

43
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:38,416
The people.

44
00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:41,125
Everything except me and Kai.

45
00:01:41,693 --> 00:01:44,065
The red button doesn't control the weather.

46
00:01:44,860 --> 00:01:46,322
It pauses the world.

47
00:01:46,793 --> 00:01:48,862
And there is no unpause button.

